Production of Recombinant Antimicrobial Polymeric
Protein Beta Casein-E 50-52 and Its Antimicrobial
Synergistic Effects Assessment with Thymol
Shohreh Fahimirad 1 , Hamid Abtahi 2, *, Seyed Hadi Razavi 1 , Houshang Alizadeh 1 and
Mansour Ghorbanpour 3
1
2
